00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,666
Equivalents do not change when you add water, so N one V one equals N two V two.

2
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:13,307
Eleven point six times V one equals zero point one times five hundred, which is fifty.

3
00:00:13,307 --> 00:00:19,218
V one is fifty over eleven point six, four point three one cubic centimetres.

